{"id":"msg_m_subquest_1011_s","cat":"messenger","group":{"id":"room_chilipepper","label":"Chilipepper · Quest"},"label":"1. Hi!","stage":null,"prev":null,"next":"msg_m_subquest_1011_e","speakers":{"chilipepper":"Chilipepper"},"icons":{},"lines":[{"id":"m_subquest_1011_s_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"chilipepper","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1011_s_1","text":"Hi!","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1011_s_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"chilipepper","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1011_s_2","text":"You must be {AccountData.NickName}, right?","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1011_s_3","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1011_s_3","text":"Who are you?","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1011_s_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"chilipepper","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1011_s_4","text":"Chilipepper","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1011_s_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"chilipepper","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1011_s_5","text":"Someone who's very curious about you.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1011_s_6","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1011_s_6","text":"How did you get my number?","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1011_s_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"chilipepper","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1011_s_7","text":"??","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1011_s_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"chilipepper","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1011_s_8","text":"What?","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1011_s_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"chilipepper","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1011_s_9","text":"Don't you know?","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1011_s_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"chilipepper","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1011_s_10","text":"Well, I didn't think the military academy would tell students about it. Haha.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1011_s_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"chilipepper","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1011_s_11","text":"Military academy graduates are highly sought after.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1011_s_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"chilipepper","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1011_s_12","text":"It's safe to say that you graduates have the attention of all the people in Ark.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1011_s_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"chilipepper","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1011_s_13","text":"Talk about elite, right? Haha.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1011_s_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"chilipepper","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1011_s_14","text":"Not to mention that you can ask Nikkes to do whatever you want.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1011_s_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"chilipepper","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1011_s_15","text":"There are many opportunistic people in the Ark, you know.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1011_s_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"chilipepper","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1011_s_16","text":"Including myself.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1011_s_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"chilipepper","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1011_s_17","text":"So the info of military academy graduates","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1011_s_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"chilipepper","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1011_s_18","text":"naturally gets leaked and put up for sale the moment they graduate.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1011_s_19","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1011_s_19","text":"How much?","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1011_s_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"chilipepper","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1011_s_20","text":"Cheap.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1011_s_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"chilipepper","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1011_s_21","text":"A lot cheaper than you think.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1011_s_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"chilipepper","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1011_s_22","text":"You'd be surprised.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1011_s_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"chilipepper","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1011_s_23","text":"So I guess I'm not the only one who has the information.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1011_s_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"chilipepper","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1011_s_24","text":"Like I said, there are many opportunistic people in the Ark.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1011_s_25","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1011_s_25","text":"So what are you after?","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1011_s_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"chilipepper","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1011_s_26","text":"Whoa.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1011_s_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"chilipepper","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1011_s_27","text":"You're a fast thinker, aren't you?","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1011_s_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"chilipepper","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1011_s_28","text":"Elite indeed. Haha.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1011_s_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"chilipepper","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1011_s_29","text":"I need a favor from you.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1011_s_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"chilipepper","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1011_s_30","text":"Remember the place where you did your first mission?","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1011_s_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"chilipepper","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1011_s_31","text":"I need you to confirm something there.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1011_s_32","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1011_s_32","text":"Confirm?","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1011_s_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"chilipepper","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1011_s_33","text":"Okay.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1011_s_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"chilipepper","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1011_s_34","text":"I'll give you the coordinates.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1011_s_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"chilipepper","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1011_s_35","text":"You should find a ceramic tile that's different from others there.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1011_s_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"chilipepper","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1011_s_36","text":"I need you to confirm what is under that tile.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1011_s_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"chilipepper","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1011_s_37","text":"Ah.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1011_s_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"chilipepper","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1011_s_38","text":"I'll make the trip worth your while.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1011_s_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"chilipepper","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1011_s_39","text":"I do have good conscience, you know. Hahaha.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1011_s_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"chilipepper","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1011_s_40","text":"What do you say? Interested?","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1011_s_41","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1011_s_41","text":"All right, I got it.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1011_s_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"chilipepper","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1011_s_42","text":"Oh.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1011_s_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"chilipepper","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1011_s_43","text":"I'll be waiting.","jump":null}],"chat":true}